==============================================================================
PREAMBLE: THE COVENANT OF DIGITAL SOVEREIGNTY & UNIVERSAL CONTINUITY
==============================================================================

Modern software is the foundational nervous system of human civilization. It
coordinates energy grids, guides healthcare triage, powers global trade,
directs autonomous systems, and preserves human knowledge.

Yet for more than four decades, computing was tethered to fragile paradigms:
systems that crash upon network disconnection, data corrupted by power drops,
code that discards user intent during disruptions, and software locked into
monolithic centralized platforms.

The Haven Programming Language was conceived, architected, and engineered by
Anirudha Puthraya to inaugurate a new era: Software Sovereign by Design.

Haven embeds mathematical digital continuity, hardware-sealed memory records,
natural human linguistic grammar, dimensional physical safety, and universal
living intent directly into the virtual machine execution substrate.

This License governs the use, development, reproduction, and distribution of
the Haven Programming Language, its compilers, runtimes, virtual machines,
standard libraries, and reference implementations.

